bind Submit Benefit Request: Request ID, Employee ID, Benefit Type, Benefit Amount
bind Review Benefit Request: Request ID, Employee ID
bind Approve Benefit: Request ID, Employee ID, Request Status
bind Reject Benefit: Request ID, Employee ID, Request Status
bind Process Payment: Request ID, Employee ID, Benefit Amount
