Request ID: integer between 1 and 10000
Employee ID: integer between 1 and 10000
Benefit Type: Health Insurance, Retirement Plan, Paid Leave, Education Assistance
Benefit Amount: float between 100.0 and 10000.0
Request Status: Approved, Rejected
Audit ID: integer between 1 and 10000
Utilization Rate: float between 0.0 and 100.0
Existence[Review Benefit Request] | |
Precedence[Approve Benefit, Review Benefit Request] |A.Request Status is Approved |A.Request ID == T.Request ID AND A.Employee ID == T.Employee ID |
Precedence[Reject Benefit, Review Benefit Request] |A.Request Status is Rejected |A.Request ID == T.Request ID AND A.Employee ID == T.Employee ID |
Response[Approve Benefit, Process Payment] | |A.Request ID == T.Request ID AND A.Employee ID == T.Employee ID |
Response[Approve Benefit, Update Employee Record] | |A.Request ID == T.Request ID AND A.Employee ID == T.Employee ID |
Response[Approve Benefit, Notify Employee] | |A.Request ID == T.Request ID AND A.Employee ID == T.Employee ID |0,2,d
Response[Reject Benefit, Notify Employee] | |A.Request ID == T.Request ID AND A.Employee ID == T.Employee ID |0,2,d
Response[Process Payment, Audit Benefit Process] | |A.Request ID == T.Request ID |0,30,d
Response[Submit Appeal, Review Appeal] | |A.Request ID == T.Request ID AND A.Employee ID == T.Employee ID |0,5,d
Precedence[Approve Appeal, Review Appeal] | |A.Request ID == T.Request ID AND A.Employee ID == T.Employee ID |
Precedence[Reject Appeal, Review Appeal] | |A.Request ID == T.Request ID AND A.Employee ID == T.Employee ID |
